  "limitations": [
    "Controlled room with current baked-map shader and eight real VRMs. Static models; no gameplay, particles, map occlusion or stereo. Eight effect lights with four map lights deliberately exceeds Mobile's per-mesh omni limit.",
    "Medians across three blocks, with two baseline samples per block. All raw samples retained.",
